(6805223, 1022144, 66267, '<td valign="top">I think the tones in this are excellent, very reminiscent of your own style (i''ve seen you process shots like this before, you''ll have to tell me how!). the one thing i see that might be hurting the score is the person in the image. the scene itself is powerful, poignant, stormy and emotional; the person''s pose is fun and playful, and some people might not like that contrast. I can''t fault this image technically; i think it deserves at least a 6 for sure.<br/> <br/>edit to add: just came back to say how great your style is, it''s definitely a dpc friendly style. don''t shy away from it.</td>', 'I think the tones in this are excellent, very reminiscent of your own style (i''ve seen you process shots like this before, you''ll have to tell me how!). the one thing i see that might be hurting the score is the person in the image. the scene itself is powerful, poignant, stormy and emotional; the person''s pose is fun and playful, and some people might not like that contrast. I can''t fault this image technically; i think it deserves at least a 6 for sure. edit to add: just came back to say how great your style is, it''s definitely a dpc friendly style. don''t shy away from it.', '2012-07-01 03:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
