(6805248, 1023196, 103032, '<td valign="top">This requires a longer look to absorb the scene.  In some ways, I wonder if the composition (or framing) would have given this an entirely different feel/message if adjusted to include more of the crowd. I do wonder what sort of event this is. Are they lined up, or just passing by.  Your choice to center the despondent looking guy amongst a crowd that appears not to care fits the message in your title, but there is the lady behind the tiera lady that seems to be giving the guy a hard look... A photo to ponder. Will be interesting to see where this lands in a free study. Also will be interested to read your notes on the context of the photo.</td>', 'This requires a longer look to absorb the scene.  In some ways, I wonder if the composition (or framing) would have given this an entirely different feel/message if adjusted to include more of the crowd. I do wonder what sort of event this is. Are they lined up, or just passing by.  Your choice to center the despondent looking guy amongst a crowd that appears not to care fits the message in your title, but there is the lady behind the tiera lady that seems to be giving the guy a hard look... A photo to ponder. Will be interesting to see where this lands in a free study. Also will be interested to read your notes on the context of the photo.', '2012-07-01 03:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
