(6805259, 1023634, 103032, '<td valign="top">Gee, her pupils are dilated... I have to say its almost creepy. Don''t mean to be offensive, but I think a viewer is drawn to the eyes and the pupils seem unnaturally dilated. I think the pose would have been better if her mouth was closed. On then positive note, the lighting is nice.</td>', 'Gee, her pupils are dilated... I have to say its almost creepy. Don''t mean to be offensive, but I think a viewer is drawn to the eyes and the pupils seem unnaturally dilated. I think the pose would have been better if her mouth was closed. On then positive note, the lighting is nice.', '2012-07-01 04:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6805260, 1022409, 117037, '<td valign="top">Ooooh...so beautiful, the lighting, the mist, the colors...10.</td>', 'Ooooh...so beautiful, the lighting, the mist, the colors...10.', '2012-07-01 04:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6805262, 1023563, 103032, '<td valign="top">Aah, alexkc from the wide angle challenge.  I read your notes on the wide angle minimal editing challenge. I think more processing worked well with that shot in that the boarder was behind the highlights in the sky. In this particular shot, the processing to the sky makes the boarder blend into/fade into the sky, especially his head, and his right arm. Maybe a case of less processing is more...  Not voting since I recognize th pic.</td>', 'Aah, alexkc from the wide angle challenge.  I read your notes on the wide angle minimal editing challenge. I think more processing worked well with that shot in that the boarder was behind the highlights in the sky. In this particular shot, the processing to the sky makes the boarder blend into/fade into the sky, especially his head, and his right arm. Maybe a case of less processing is more...  Not voting since I recognize th pic.', '2012-07-01 04:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6805263, 1023198, 67258, '<td valign="top">A Little Grebe?  A pleasing photo of these rather shy little ducks. The slight tilt bothers me somewhat, and the grain and consequent lack of textural detail is a bit of a problem - I would imagine this is a very heavy crop; certainly I have only ever managed to get distant shots of them! Composition and exposure are both good, and those reflections really are lovely.</td>', 'A Little Grebe?  A pleasing photo of these rather shy little ducks. The slight tilt bothers me somewhat, and the grain and consequent lack of textural detail is a bit of a problem - I would imagine this is a very heavy crop; certainly I have only ever managed to get distant shots of them! Composition and exposure are both good, and those reflections really are lovely.', '2012-07-01 04:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6805264, 1023600, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s not a Joshua Tree. THIS is a Joshua Tree:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//i-cdn.apartmenttherapy.com/uimages/la/082108joshua-01.jpg/082108joshua-01.jpg'', strrpos(''//i-cdn.apartmenttherapy.com/uimages/la/082108joshua-01.jpg/082108joshua-01.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//i-cdn.apartmenttherapy.com/uimages/la/082108joshua-01.jpg/082108joshua-01.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>What you have is some sort of wind-wracked pine or cypress.<br/> <br/>Cool tree, cool picture. Reminds me of home.</td>', 'That''s not a Joshua Tree. THIS is a Joshua Tree:   What you have is some sort of wind-wracked pine or cypress. Cool tree, cool picture. Reminds me of home.', '2012-07-01 04:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
