(6806300, 1022630, 114233, '<td valign="top">Only looked through the thumbnails so far and this one caught my eye - I like landscapes so its not surprising but there is something special about this shot.<br/>The composition is really nice and the blending of shots to increase the dynamic range has been expertly done. I doubt Photomatix was used - hope I''m not wrong, it looks more "natural" although it obviously is not. I can see a small halo along the top of the horison where land meets sky but its really insignificant compared to the beauty you have captured here.<br/>Overall a superb job and I hope to see it on the front page!</td>', 'Only looked through the thumbnails so far and this one caught my eye - I like landscapes so its not surprising but there is something special about this shot.The composition is really nice and the blending of shots to increase the dynamic range has been expertly done. I doubt Photomatix was used - hope I''m not wrong, it looks more "natural" although it obviously is not. I can see a small halo along the top of the horison where land meets sky but its really insignificant compared to the beauty you have captured here.Overall a superb job and I hope to see it on the front page!', '2012-07-02 07:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
