(6808939, 1023226, 67258, '<td valign="top">The lens baby (?) lends a very strange effect to this, and your choice of processing style takes this further.  The odd focus, with parts that overlap each other being both in and out of focus plays havoc with my mind!  In terms of a natural history photo, I hate it, but in artistic terms I do find there is something strangely compelling.  I will return to score, becuase I honestly can''t decide!</td>', 'The lens baby (?) lends a very strange effect to this, and your choice of processing style takes this further.  The odd focus, with parts that overlap each other being both in and out of focus plays havoc with my mind!  In terms of a natural history photo, I hate it, but in artistic terms I do find there is something strangely compelling.  I will return to score, becuase I honestly can''t decide!', '2012-07-04 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
