(6808944, 1019268, 67258, '<td valign="top">The cluttered background really distracts, and in particular the very bright section at the top.  The light is not conducive to good photography, with shadows to the right, and blown areas to the left. I suspect that either a wider view, or a tighter crop would have been more effective.</td>', 'The cluttered background really distracts, and in particular the very bright section at the top.  The light is not conducive to good photography, with shadows to the right, and blown areas to the left. I suspect that either a wider view, or a tighter crop would have been more effective.', '2012-07-04 16:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
