(6808946, 1023725, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the baby''s delicate ''fresh'' skin against the muscular, tattooed arm.  Not so keen on the lighting - I want to focus on both arm and baby equally, but my eyes are pulled to the man''s brightly lit shoulder.  On a purely subjective level, I really dislike the flower headband type photo prop on baby photos, but I do acknowledge that is a very personal bias.</td>', 'I like the idea of the baby''s delicate ''fresh'' skin against the muscular, tattooed arm.  Not so keen on the lighting - I want to focus on both arm and baby equally, but my eyes are pulled to the man''s brightly lit shoulder.  On a purely subjective level, I really dislike the flower headband type photo prop on baby photos, but I do acknowledge that is a very personal bias.', '2012-07-04 16:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
