(6815181, 1023421, 108580, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. An ''old'' subject but uniquely shot and wd on 1/30th and sharp! Had no idea you could get up the Arc! Normal tourists get access? One of my fave buildings in Paris. Will do it next time I''m there! Great finish.</td>', 'Stunning image. An ''old'' subject but uniquely shot and wd on 1/30th and sharp! Had no idea you could get up the Arc! Normal tourists get access? One of my fave buildings in Paris. Will do it next time I''m there! Great finish.', '2012-07-11 03:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
