(6817052, 1023419, 119012, '<td valign="top">im curious as how you got the background so black and such a lowkey shot? at 1/2500 it seems like it would be daytime and f/2 wouldn''t kill the ambient like that.<br/> <br/>impressive you got this outdoors and not in a studio setting.<br/> <br/></td>', 'im curious as how you got the background so black and such a lowkey shot? at 1/2500 it seems like it would be daytime and f/2 wouldn''t kill the ambient like that. impressive you got this outdoors and not in a studio setting. ', '2012-07-13 10:51:30.000000', NULL, 0),
