(6821288, 1021349, 31239, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all you comments, I am pleased with 28 place from 240 submissions.<br/> <br/>Yes, it was pretty much the right place at the right time, the first place I decided to stand was about 15 people deep, so I moved to this place and it was 3 people deep AND it just so happened where her car stopped to drop off her, Will &amp; Kate.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cowboy221977:</b></div><hr/><i> This was taken in Ireland...right....Hey I may be american but I love British Royalty...Nice shot..the reflection in the window is a little distracting but overall a good shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Most Americans love British Royalty, but this image was taken in Nottingham (where Robin Hood came from lol).<br/>I agree about the reflection in the window / driver of the car is a little distracting, but it gives a bit of a story to the image too.</td>', 'Thanks for all you comments, I am pleased with 28 place from 240 submissions. Yes, it was pretty much the right place at the right time, the first place I decided to stand was about 15 people deep, so I moved to this place and it was 3 people deep AND it just so happened where her car stopped to drop off her, Will & Kate. Originally posted by cowboy221977: This was taken in Ireland...right....Hey I may be american but I love British Royalty...Nice shot..the reflection in the window is a little distracting but overall a good shot   Most Americans love British Royalty, but this image was taken in Nottingham (where Robin Hood came from lol).I agree about the reflection in the window / driver of the car is a little distracting, but it gives a bit of a story to the image too.', '2012-07-19 12:50:32.000000', NULL, 0),
