(6848976, 1023747, 62187, '<td valign="top">That''s a super nice photo. I like the long light and wide array of colors. The crop is perfect. Nice job and reducing the noise however you did it - in camera or out. The clouds I think are a bonus...</td>', 'That''s a super nice photo. I like the long light and wide array of colors. The crop is perfect. Nice job and reducing the noise however you did it - in camera or out. The clouds I think are a bonus...', '2012-08-25 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6854416, 1023484, 108580, '<td valign="top">Thoroughly enjoyed this image, smooth creamy, colourful and simple. 7. WD on the HM in a FS.</td>', 'Thoroughly enjoyed this image, smooth creamy, colourful and simple. 7. WD on the HM in a FS.', '2012-09-02 13:21:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6858409, 1023280, 67152, '<td valign="top">I thought this one was brilliant when I saw it during voting.  And at first, I thought it might very well be a combination of multiple images.    I think you hit this one out of the park on attempting to achieve the startling and intense look of Peter Funch in a single snap.  Well done!</td>', 'I thought this one was brilliant when I saw it during voting.  And at first, I thought it might very well be a combination of multiple images.    I think you hit this one out of the park on attempting to achieve the startling and intense look of Peter Funch in a single snap.  Well done!', '2012-09-06 16:42:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6858421, 1023280, 68020, '<td valign="top">I have to appologize for the vote I gave for this. I gave it a 5 and it should really be much higher. The more I look at the image the more I''m drawn in...so many stories...</td>', 'I have to appologize for the vote I gave for this. I gave it a 5 and it should really be much higher. The more I look at the image the more I''m drawn in...so many stories...', '2012-09-06 17:01:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6858427, 1023280, 42256, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible picture - I love crowds like these.  I gave this a 6 during voting, with a little different editing/crop this could have been an 8 or 9 from me.<br/> <br/>Suggestions in my opinion what would have worked well  - crop the bottom till the shoulder of the out of focus lady in foreground, and from right till the man on the phone (left shoulder). Paint with light to direct your eye to either one of the man in the hats.</td>', 'This is an incredible picture - I love crowds like these.  I gave this a 6 during voting, with a little different editing/crop this could have been an 8 or 9 from me. Suggestions in my opinion what would have worked well  - crop the bottom till the shoulder of the out of focus lady in foreground, and from right till the man on the phone (left shoulder). Paint with light to direct your eye to either one of the man in the hats.', '2012-09-06 17:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
