(6940266, 1022446, 152252, '<td valign="top">I''m a reflections freak so that''s one of the things I love in this picture. I mean there is everything in it... Beautiful horses, water, amazing clouds... Your pictures definitely speaks better than my words :)</td>', 'I''m a reflections freak so that''s one of the things I love in this picture. I mean there is everything in it... Beautiful horses, water, amazing clouds... Your pictures definitely speaks better than my words :)', '2012-12-22 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6940761, 1022446, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, and the reflection.  But mainly, I like how the picture looks like a flag.  Good one.</td>', 'I like the colours, and the reflection.  But mainly, I like how the picture looks like a flag.  Good one.', '2012-12-23 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6940768, 1022446, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo - I want to be there .. haven''t ridden a horse in 40 years but I would if I had a place like this .. thanks for posting this shot.</td>', 'What a beautiful photo - I want to be there .. haven''t ridden a horse in 40 years but I would if I had a place like this .. thanks for posting this shot.', '2012-12-23 14:58:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6950006, 1023753, 10785, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!</b> <br/> <br/>Just looking through your profile finding a few images with a few comments only in order to give you some more feedback.<br/> <br/>Here you have captured a nice, gritty, character portrait. I voted this a 6 in the challenge and the reasons for my vote were that it had great technicals with good exposure and sharpness. I found his face to be in shadow with the light coming in from behind his rightside making his eyes a little dark. The B&amp;W conversion was very well done wth good tones and I like the gritty edge to this up close and personal capture.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!  Just looking through your profile finding a few images with a few comments only in order to give you some more feedback. Here you have captured a nice, gritty, character portrait. I voted this a 6 in the challenge and the reasons for my vote were that it had great technicals with good exposure and sharpness. I found his face to be in shadow with the light coming in from behind his rightside making his eyes a little dark. The B&W conversion was very well done wth good tones and I like the gritty edge to this up close and personal capture.', '2013-01-05 21:01:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6970809, 1022409, 30982, '<td valign="top">Something you really need to take a few moments to linger with.  It has the initial "oohhh, wow" but an even more subtle elegance as you sit and watch.  Lovely layers of color, that quiet waterfall in the back, and the shy stardom of your little tree, surrounded by yellow.  So gorgeous.</td>', 'Something you really need to take a few moments to linger with.  It has the initial "oohhh, wow" but an even more subtle elegance as you sit and watch.  Lovely layers of color, that quiet waterfall in the back, and the shy stardom of your little tree, surrounded by yellow.  So gorgeous.', '2013-02-03 19:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6971649, 1022667, 62318, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the different textures in this shot.</td>', 'I enjoy the different textures in this shot.', '2013-02-04 13:04:32.000000', NULL, 0),
