(7123088, 1023634, 57650, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2013-10-29 07:44:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7439793, 1023085, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like how much of the cloud detail is maintained in the reflection.<br/> <br/>Not sure if it''s the case here, but I find when I shoot bodies of water with a receding shoreline it often makes it look as if the horizon is tilted, even though the camera might have been perfectly horizontal. Perhaps a better check is the levelness of the bottom of the cloud layer ...</td>', 'I like how much of the cloud detail is maintained in the reflection. Not sure if it''s the case here, but I find when I shoot bodies of water with a receding shoreline it often makes it look as if the horizon is tilted, even though the camera might have been perfectly horizontal. Perhaps a better check is the levelness of the bottom of the cloud layer ...', '2016-02-26 17:45:41.000000', NULL, 0),
